  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Facilitate changes within the policy and regulatory environment towards vulnerable population and unemployed refugees and Turkish citizens. Advocacy and awareness raising on addressing bottlenecks in the economic and regulatory environment, leverage and sustain the impact on targeted beneficiaries&#x2019; wellbeing by supporting policy change and implementation of the GoT&#x2019;s refugee policies.</narrative>
  </description>
